# HaloMCCVRInject.exe as submitted to Microsoft as a Defender false positive. Microsoft clears a file by its exact
# bytes, so releases ship that file itself (tools/injector-cleared/HaloMCCVRInject.exe, which must hash to this) rather
# than a rebuild, whose build stamps change with every compiler or Windows SDK update. tools/package-candidate.ps1
# checks that the rebuilt injector is still the same program (tools/compare-injector-code.ps1) and refuses to package
# a changed one unless told the change is intended (-AcceptInjectorChange). See AGENTS.md, "The mod loader".
